WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:08.148
At the top of your rankings is this month's bid at a glance: how long until bidding closes, and a checklist of where you are.

00:00:08.148 --> 00:00:11.938
Set a reminder in your calendar so you don't miss the close.

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:16.953
If a trip from last month runs into this one, add it under carry-in.

00:00:16.953 --> 00:00:23.108
Your lines are then scored as they'll really fly, with any trip it knocks off taken into account.

00:00:37.259 --> 00:00:47.850
If the pack's vacation schedule shows you have vacation this month, choose how to treat it: use it, or keep your flying and let the lines it barely touches rise.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:55.660
And with your seniority number in, "Your chances" estimates which lines could still be open when it's your turn.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:59.342
"Realistic" shows only the lines you have a real shot at —

00:00:59.342 --> 00:01:01.246
and every line shows its odds.

